 stroke-width="2"></path></svg></span></div><div class="FuturisIconWithDescriptionCard-Description"><div class="FuturisIconWithDescriptionCard-FirstLine"><h3 class="FuturisInlineHeader-Title">Быстрый ответ Алисы AI</h3></div></div></div></a><div class="FuturisInlineHeaderRightActions"><button class="VanillaReact Extralinks Extralinks_id_2_h7ajw0f-0-33 Extralinks_hidden Extralinks_hidden FuturisInlineHeader-Extralinks" id="2_h7ajw0f-0-33" aria-label="Действия" aria-haspopup="menu" data-vnl="{&quot;uniqId&quot;:&quot;2_h7ajw0f-0-33&quot;,&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;variant&quot;:&quot;futurisAbout&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:1,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;_blank&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Об Алисе&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://yandex.ru/support/search/ru/alica&quot;},{&quot;variant&quot;:&quot;futurisDisclaimer&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:2,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Ответ сформирован искусственным интеллектом на основе текстов с разных сайтов. В нём могут быть неточности.&quot;}],&quot;popupProps&quot;:{&quot;zIndex&quot;:21001}}" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-33" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-behaviour="dynamic"><span class="Icon2 Icon2_embed Icon2_size_16 Extralinks-Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 1rem; height: 1rem;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1rem" height="1rem" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" class="Icon2-Content"><circle cx="8" cy="2.5" r="1.5"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="1.5"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="13.5" r="1.5"></circle></svg></span></button></div></div><div class="FactFold FactFold_height-limited FactFold_mode_default"><div class="FactFold-Container" id="FactFold702032142988" style="max-height: 160px; height: auto;"><article class="Futuris-RequestResponsePair Futuris-RequestResponsePair_isLast Futuris-RequestResponseContent"><section class="FuturisGPTMessage"><section class="FuturisGPTMessage-GroupContent"><h3 class="A11yHidden">Содержимое ответа</h3><div class="FuturisGPTMessage-GroupContentComponentWrapper"><section class="FuturisContentSection FuturisRSRContent-CompositionBlock" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-36"><div class="FuturisMarkdown FuturisMarkdown_theme_common FuturisRSRContent-Block" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-37" translate="no"><div data-end-streaming-block="true"></div><div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph"><strong>Тейлор Элисон Свифт</strong> (Taylor Alison Swift)&nbsp;—&nbsp;американская певица и автор песен, одна из ключевых фигур в поп-музыке. Родилась 13&nbsp;декабря 1989&nbsp;года в Уэст-Рединге, Пенсильвания, США.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82,_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3a" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://zvuk.com/artist/96454" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3c" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://zvuk.com?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>zvuk.com</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.rbc.ru/person/66608cb19a79476f0c08d6e4" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3e" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.rbc.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>rbc.ru</span></a></div></div></section><section class="FuturisContentSection FuturisRSRContent-CompositionBlock" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3f"><h2 class="FuturisTitle FuturisContentSection-Title">Карьера</h2><div class="FuturisMarkdown FuturisMarkdown_theme_common FuturisRSRContent-Block" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3g" translate="no"><div data-end-streaming-block="true"></div><div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">Свифт начала профессионально заниматься музыкой в 14&nbsp;лет. В 2005&nbsp;году подписала контракт с независимым лейблом Big Machine Records. В 2006&nbsp;году выпустила дебютный сингл Tim McGraw и одноимённый альбом, который принёс ей широкую известность.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82,_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3j" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://kino.mail.ru/person/500665_taylor_swift/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3l" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://kino.mail.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>kino.mail.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://zvuk.com/artist/96454" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3n" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://zvuk.com?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>zvuk.com</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">Некоторые этапы её карьеры:</div>
<ul class="FuturisMarkdown-UnorderedList"><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0"><strong>Fearless (2008)</strong>. Второй альбом, который занял первое место в чарте Billboard&nbsp;200 и принёс певице премию «Грэмми» в категории «Альбом года». Песни Love Story и You Belong with Me стали мировыми хитами.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://kino.mail.ru/person/500665_taylor_swift/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3p" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://kino.mail.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>kino.mail.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://postnews.ru/a/44880" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3r" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://postnews.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>postnews.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82,_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3t" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a></li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0"><strong>Speak Now (2010)</strong>. В этом альбоме вобрались элементы рока.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82,_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3v" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a></li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0"><strong>Red (2012)</strong>. Эксперимент с электро-музыкой.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82,_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3x" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a></li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0"><strong>1989 (2014)</strong>. С выходом этого синти-поп альбома певица перешла от кантри к поп-музыке. Синглы Shake it Off, Blank Space и Bad Blood возглавили мировые чарты.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82,_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-3z" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://zvuk.com/artist/96454" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-311" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://zvuk.com?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>zvuk.com</span></a></li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0"><strong>Reputation (2017)</strong>.&nbsp;</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0"><strong>Lover (2019)</strong>.&nbsp;</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0"><strong>Folklore и Evermore (2020)</strong>&nbsp;—&nbsp;инди-фолк и альт-рок-альбомы.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82,_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-313" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a></li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0"><strong>Midnights (2022)</strong>.&nbsp;</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0"><strong>The Tortured Poets Department (2024)</strong>.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82,_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-315" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://zvuk.com/artist/96454" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-317" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://zvuk.com?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>zvuk.com</span></a></li></ul>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">В 2019&nbsp;году после конфликта с Big Machine Records Свифт перезаписала четыре из своих первых шести альбомов с пометкой Taylor’s Version.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82,_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-319" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">В 2023&nbsp;году она отправилась в самый масштабный концертный тур The Eras Tour.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82,_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31b" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a></div></div></section><section class="FuturisContentSection FuturisRSRContent-CompositionBlock" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31c"><h2 class="FuturisTitle FuturisContentSection-Title">Достижения и награды</h2><div class="FuturisMarkdown FuturisMarkdown_theme_common FuturisRSRContent-Block" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31d" translate="no"><div data-end-streaming-block="true"></div><div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">Тейлор Свифт&nbsp;—&nbsp;рекордсмен по числу наград. Среди её достижений:</div>
<ul class="FuturisMarkdown-UnorderedList"><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">14&nbsp;премий «Грэмми»;</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">40&nbsp;статуэток American Music Awards (рекорд среди музыкантов);</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">49&nbsp;премий Billboard Music Awards (также рекорд);</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">30&nbsp;MTV Video Music Awards;</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">одна прайм-таймовая премия «Эмми»;</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">12&nbsp;премий Ассоциации кантри-музыки (включая Pinnacle Award);</li><li class="FuturisMarkdown-ListItem" data-value="" data-shift="0">восемь наград Academy of Country Music Awards.</li></ul>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82,_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31g" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%BA_%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4_%D0%B8_%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80_%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31i" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">Она стала первой и единственной артисткой, одержавшей четыре победы в номинации «Лучший альбом года».&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.rbc.ru/person/66608cb19a79476f0c08d6e4" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31k" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.rbc.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>rbc.ru</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">В 2023&nbsp;году журнал Time признал её «Человеком года».&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%84%D1%82,_%D0%A2%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31m" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://ru.wikipedia.org?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>ru.wikipedia.org</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://kino.mail.ru/person/500665_taylor_swift/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31o" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://kino.mail.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>kino.mail.ru</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">По данным на 2024&nbsp;год, состояние певицы оценивалось в $1,6&nbsp;млрд.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.rbc.ru/person/66608cb19a79476f0c08d6e4" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31q" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.rbc.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>rbc.ru</span></a></div></div></section><section class="FuturisContentSection FuturisRSRContent-CompositionBlock" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31r"><h2 class="FuturisTitle FuturisContentSection-Title">Личная жизнь</h2><div class="FuturisMarkdown FuturisMarkdown_theme_common FuturisRSRContent-Block" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31s" translate="no"><div data-end-streaming-block="true"></div><div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">В 2026&nbsp;году Тейлор Свифт вышла замуж за американского футболиста Трэвиса Келси. Церемония прошла в Нью-Йорке на арене Мэдисон-сквер-гарден.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.letu.ru/blog/muza-mesyacza-tejlor-svift-lichnaya-zhizn-pravila-zhizni-i-istoriya-bolshoj-lyubvi" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31v" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.letu.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>letu.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.psychologies.ru/articles/teilor-svift-vyshla-zamuzh-glavnye-podrobnosti-sobytiya-goda-i-chto-zhdet-pevicu-v-brake-s-futbolistom-trevisom-kelsi/" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31x" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.psychologies.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>psychologies.ru</span></a></div>
<div class="FuturisMarkdown-Paragraph">У певицы было несколько романов с известными мужчинами, многим из которых она посвящала песни после расставания.&nbsp;<a class="Link FuturisFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.letu.ru/blog/muza-mesyacza-tejlor-svift-lichnaya-zhizn-pravila-zhizni-i-istoriya-bolshoj-lyubvi" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-31z" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.letu.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>letu.ru</span></a><a class="Link FuturisFootnote FuturisFootnote_lastFootnote" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://www.rbc.ru/person/66608cb19a79476f0c08d6e4" data-counter="[&quot;b&quot;]" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-321" target="_blank"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Content" data-nosnippet="true"><span class="FuturisFootnote-Icon" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://favicon.yandex.net/favicon/v2/https://www.rbc.ru?size=32&amp;stub=1&quot;);"></span>rbc.ru</span></a></div></div></section></div></section><div class="FuturisGPTMessage-GroupScrollerWrapper"><div class="Scroller Scroller_sameHeight Scroller_scrollDirection_none Scroller_hasArrows Scroller_hasArrows Scroller_theme_futuris FuturisGPTMessage-GroupScroller" data-log-node="2_h7ajw0f-0-322"><div class="Scroller-Container"><div class="ArrowButton ArrowButton_direction_left ArrowButton_hidden ArrowButton_withShadows Scroller-Arrow"></div><div class="Scroller-Wrap"><div role="list" class="Scroller-ItemsWrap"><div class="FuturisActionsPanel"><div class="FuturisActionsPanel-ActionsBlock"><div class="FactFeedback FuturisFeedback"><div class="FuturisFeedback-ButtonWrapper"><h4 class="A11yHidden">Оценить ответ</h4><div class="FactFeedback-ButtonWrap"><button aria-label="Понравилось" type="button" class="Button Button_pin_circle-circle FactFeedback-ReactionButton FactFeedback-ReactionButton_t